WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.150
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:05.610
Dr. Bright! No cringeworthy impressions!

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:10.770
We get it, you like movies, everyone likes movies.&nbsp;
But what people don't like is hearing you come up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:16.170
behind them while they're working and give them&nbsp;
your best "Why so serious?" in a Joker voice.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:21.390
This also goes for "You wanna know&nbsp;
how I got these scars?" No Borat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:25.050
Ace Ventura, or Kermit the Frog&nbsp;
impressions either. In fact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:30.090
just don't speak in any voices that resemble&nbsp;
a character from popular media. Ever.

